hainsaw kills drop ammunition, and hiding behind cover gets you nowhere. Weapons such as the shotgun, plasma rifle and rocket launcher can be upgraded with modifications.\n\nId Software built this reboot around speed, so jumping, double jumping and ledge grabs matter as much as aiming, and a heavy metal soundtrack drives the pace. Multiplayer modes and SnapMap, a tool for building and sharing your own levels, extend it past the campaign. It suits players who want a fast, loud, demanding shooter."}}